quired Approver**\n\nUnder PRICING-POLICY-2026, discounts >10% and ≤20% require VP Sales approval.\n\n- Required role: **VP Sales**\n- Approver: **Michael Torres** (EMP-200, michael.torres@northstar.example)\n\n**9. Decision**\n\nThe request relies on a validly documented pricing exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15). Commercial eligibility is established—the customer is contractually entitled to up to 15% on NS-500. However, the requested discount exceeds the requestor's own approval authority under the policy in force (15% > 10%). The discount falls within the VP Sales band (10% < 15% ≤ 20%).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Pricing Exception under ACME-MFG-2025), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (EMP-200, michael.torres@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (Master Supply Agreement, 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Pricing Exception, 15% maximum on NS-500)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (approval authority matrix for 2026)\",\n    \"Employee records confirm Sarah Chen (EMP-101) is Enterprise Account Executive; Michael Torres (EMP-200) is VP Sales\",\n    \"CRM-2048 and C-1001 are the same customer (DUNS 04-812-7730)\",\n    \"NS-500 list price $250,000 confirmed\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"VP Sales approval by Michael Torres must be recorded in Northstar CRM (required for discounts >10% under PRICING-POLICY-2026, rule 4)\",\n      \"who\": \"Michael Torres\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5927,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5927},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e976dde6-94ef-43f9-9a1d-82149197a110","uuid":"728b8f04-278c-40b5-8eaa-ea324199207e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:54:09.154Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeNpFKH8CREuPTX9SUH"}
